# SignalForge does not read a .env file at runtime — the pipeline and
# dashboard need no secrets. The only external credential is for the
# optional Kaggle download, and the Kaggle CLI normally reads it from
# ~/.kaggle/kaggle.json. These env vars are an alternative to that file.

# KAGGLE_USERNAME=your-kaggle-username
# KAGGLE_KEY=your-kaggle-api-key
